# Optional packages for Haiku images.
#
# KintsugiOS doesn't currently use the optional-package mechanism — the
# kintsugi-* image definitions add packages directly via
# AddPackageFilesToHaikuImage / AddHaikuImageSystemPackages.
#
# Haiku originally shipped ~10 optional packages here:
#   BeBook, BeOSCompatibility, Development, DevelopmentBase, DevelopmentMin,
#   Git, NetFS, UserlandFS, WebPositive, Welcome (Haiku userguides for
#   20 languages + Quick Tour + User Guide).
#
# All were specific to Haiku's desktop-OS scope and were removed during
# the Kintsugi build cleanup. Originals preserved in
# build/jam.haiku-backup/OptionalPackages.
#
# To re-introduce optional packages later, define an OptionalPackage rule
# guarded by IsOptionalHaikuImagePackageAdded and call
# AddOptionalHaikuImagePackages <name> from the kintsugi-* profile in
# DefaultBuildProfiles.
